{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Farol del Diablo </i>(<i>Devil\u2019s Lantern</i>) is a horror game set in Loma Quebrada, an Argentinian town shrouded in darkness and folklore. Equipped with a flashlight and a handful of resources, Catalina embarks on a thorough search for riches despite the rumors of the Luz Mala haunting the grounds. Uncover the dark secrets of the village before the night engulfs you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark atmosphere and an oppressive soundscape with first-person camera controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the village and speak with the townspeople to unravel the dreadful truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the treasures guarded by the Luz Mala.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your life by biting the sheath of a knife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your flashlight on\u2014she will be your best companion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome your fear of being defenseless as you face indescribable dangers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544060?t=1760908644","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544060?t=1760908644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544060/5aae8100c73b67c625b748d7bb243f39a93e0d76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760908644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544060/5aae8100c73b67c625b748d7bb243f39a93e0d76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760908644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3781650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Farol del Diablo </i>(<i>Devil